255
00:11:34,951 --> 00:11:35,641
or of course

256
00:11:36,235 --> 00:11:37,504
until we exhausted this.

257
00:11:38,178 --> 00:11:40,796
Then at some point, of course, our array is

258
00:11:40,892 --> 00:11:41,486
just empty.

259
00:11:42,339 --> 00:11:44,808
That is our max heap here.

260
00:11:45,421 --> 00:11:47,922
And now let's see how we can use this for a

